{"ID":"20240118145003-d1ibigx","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118145003-d1ibigx","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118145003-d1ibigx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118145003-5tunweo\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122164208-2c1dsof\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122164208-2c1dsof\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:377,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:377\u0026#125;","title":"359补02诃黎勒（诃子）","type":"doc","updated":"20240204155108"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118145003-5tunweo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118145003-5tunweo","updated":"20240122164147"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】产我国广东等地，其实六棱，又名诃黎勒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122164148-upqo2kj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122164148-upqo2kj"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味苦酸涩，性温，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122164149-zokhxc5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122164149-zokhxc5"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】诃子为涩肠治痢，保肺调气要药，主胸膈结气，心腹胀满，消痰，化食，通津，开胃，治心腹虚痛，肠风下血，崩带，胎漏，久痢，虚嗽。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122164152-dxgn6uw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122164152-dxgn6uw"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【唐本】主冷气。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122164153-jenqxii","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122164153-jenqxii"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】破胸膈结气，通利津液，止水道，黑髭发。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122164155-6abvj7r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122164155-6abvj7r"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【大明】消痰下气，化食开胃，除烦治水，调中止呕吐，霍乱心腹虚痛，奔豚肾气，肺气喘息，五膈气，肠风泻血，崩中带下，怀孕漏胎，及动胎欲生，胀闷气喘，痢人肛门急痛，产妇阴痛，和蜡烧烟熏之及煎汤熏洗。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122164158-xwzisd2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122164158-xwzisd2"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【萧柄】下宿物，止肠澼久泄赤白痢。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122164200-kmi4tdg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122164200-kmi4tdg"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【苏敬】治痰嗽咽喉不利，合三数枚殊胜。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122164201-2liizft","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122164201-2liizft"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【丹溪】实大肠，敛肺降火。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122164202-6xj8xiy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122164202-6xj8xiy"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通一至二钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122164203-jtypgoc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122164203-jtypgoc"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】气虚宜缓缓少用，以此虽涩肠，而又泄气也，凡咳嗽痢疾初起者，均忌。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122164147-v9r31l2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122164147-v9r31l2"}},{"ID":"20240122164204-ohi8vba","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122164204-ohi8vba","updated":"20240204154939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第二个，诃黎勒，就是我们的诃子。经方里面有诃黎勒散，你看这个诃黎勒呢，产我国广东的地方，它的实是六个角，很象那个使君子，使君子也是多好角，性味是味苦酸涩，性温无毒。这个是它酸收敛，酸涩的药，所以诃子专门是涩肠止痢的药，保肺调气的药，那张仲景实际上是用在气逆，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"就是放屁的时候好象机关枪一样砰砰砰一直气逆，那个是下痢但是没有力，腹胀排气很凶，这时我们用诃子，就是诃黎勒。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【甄权】呢：破胸膈结气，通利津液，止水道，能够让头发变黑。现在只要是能让头发变黑的，这是很热门的，或者能让很瘦的，都是很热门的。"}]},{"ID":"20240122164208-2c1dsof","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122164208-2c1dsof","updated":"20240204155108"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个【大明】呢：他说，第二段下方那边，大明的这个解说，痢人呢就是下痢的病人呢，肛门很急痛，里急后痛，产妇有阴痛，这都可以和蜡烧烟熏，用诃黎勒来烧烟来熏，那个【苏公】你看这些都是医生的临床，咽喉不利含三数枚胜，因为它能够下气嘛，能够下俗物，能够通气，收敛，所以喉咙不利的时候是喉咙闭锁住，那你想张开的话其实就是收敛，为什么，那喉咙摆成这个样子食物是可以通过去的，那现在堵到了，那你要收敛的话就要往回收，这往回收这往回收，就是收敛，管道就打开来。所以我们要用酸收的药，所以喉头才会打开来，那酸味，张仲景还担心半夏通利的还不够，把半夏泡到醋里面更酸，通利它，所以用半夏，我们讲苦酒就是醋，你说老师讲国语那个苦酒满杯，那就是醋啊，我们中医的苦酒就是醋，你不要说老师苦酒怎么做啊，已经有了，那醋就是苦酒，这个酸收知道我的意思吧，四面八方一收，喉咙就打开了，这是收。"}]}]}